{"page":20142,"part":1,"text":"方圆\n\n\n方圆\n\n方圆者，真草之体用。真贵方，草贵圆。方者参之以圆，圆者参之以方，斯为妙矣。然而方圆、曲直，不可显露，直须涵泳一出于自然。如草书尤忌横直分明，横直多则字有积薪、束苇之状，而无萧散之气。时参出之，斯为妙矣。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20142,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"96a46f9b0e66f6d0268060200c52adca3ce1344cd163b7a6c42418c6ae0c380b","textSha256":"96a46f9b0e66f6d0268060200c52adca3ce1344cd163b7a6c42418c6ae0c380b","fileSha256":"96a46f9b0e66f6d0268060200c52adca3ce1344cd163b7a6c42418c6ae0c380b","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20142-work-119.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"续书谱 · 方圆","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/kFfK8Dci4xmDsTtkMbtjRq","originalPages":[403],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"5efb5f834fb2a7b03ec83d76fd52d28346691d8c5670a9e573116edb55957cbf","id":"local-403-71-80","page_id":403,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":71,"rawEnd":80,"reviewedTextSha256":"6fe0a39acdc147c20de1f521c2a487e6ff1c7a8ee500465e5445dd8b390d7e38","displayUnitOrigins":[[77,78],[78,79],[79,80]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":403,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T14:13:16.808Z","revision":"6fe0a39acdc147c20de1f521c2a487e6ff1c7a8ee500465e5445dd8b390d7e38","textSha256":"6fe0a39acdc147c20de1f521c2a487e6ff1c7a8ee500465e5445dd8b390d7e38","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":5,"end":7,"sourceTextSha256":"bad0e38801cbe67bbf26ae84092761f64ea3f81b9896c097ea4fecefbd09f078","id":"t9u5PXY7